[00:01.14]Praise Jehovah, God of peace,
[00:06.16]God of unity.
[00:11.36]He will make all wars to cease,
[00:18.82]Bring in harmony.
[00:25.54]Prince of Peace is Christ his Son,
[00:30.58]Tender, calm, and kind.
[00:37.36]When the fight for right he’s won,
[00:43.66]Perfect peace we’ll find.
[00:54.78]We have left off angry words,
[01:00.38]Making quarrels cease.
[01:06.12]We have made from spears and swords,
[01:11.51]Implements of peace.
[01:17.98]If this peace we want to keep,
[01:23.82]Then we must forgive.
[01:28.96]Peacefully as Jesus’ sheep,
[01:35.32]May we learn and live.
[01:44.02]Peace from God gives proof to all;
[01:49.42]He has blessed our way.
[01:55.64]His commands we gladly keep,
[02:01.48]Ready to obey.
[02:06.84]We would recommend our way,
[02:12.72]Show our peaceful care
[02:17.10]Till the Kingdom’s perfect day
[02:30.34]Brings peace ev’rywhere.
